          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla ala makuĩte ĩsandũkũ ya Yeova maĩ manaenda matambya thanthatũ, athemba ng’ombe na kĩla kĩnou. ",
          "type": "text",
