              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Ndaviti asyoka aathime andũ ma nyũmba yake. Na Mikali mwĩĩtu, wa Saulo aumaala amũthaũe Ndaviti, na asya, A! Kaĩ, mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli nĩwĩnenevisye ũmũnthĩ, ũla wĩvũie ũmũnthĩ athũkũmi eĩtu ma athũkũmi make mamwene, o tondũ ũmwe wa ala mate kĩĩĩ wĩvuaa vate nthoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
